    <string name="a_propos">About</string>
    <string name="code_source">Source code</string>
    <string name="a_propos_texte">Web radios and podcasts: search the free Radio Browser directory and the podcast directory, keep favourites and folders, listen in the background, download episodes.\n\nNo account, no sign-in. No data collection: the app sends nothing about you. It only talks to Radio Browser (which counts anonymously how often each station is played), to the podcast directory, to the stations and podcasts you play, to GitHub for updates, and to your Unicorn-TV server if you pair one.\n\nFree software, GPL-3.0 licence.\n© 2026 Lestat2Lioncourt</string>
